# Resources/reference.db

# Raw source dumps — multi-GB, rebuild locally
data/

# Phase-1 food.db (USDA Foundation Foods + SR Legacy, ~1.5MB) is small
# enough to commit directly — see SETUP.md. Re-exclude this if a future
# phase (Open Food Facts branded data, FNDDS survey data) grows it back
# into multi-hundred-MB territory; Git LFS or a CI build step would be
# needed at that point instead.

